    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'This environment is specifically tailored for VR headsets and lower-end mobile devices; it is designed to run at high frame rates while still featuring beautifully stylized visuals. Furthermore, we offer a custom lighting model to showcase the ease of customizability of URP.


      To enter Play Mode, press the <b>Play</b> button at the top of the editor.'
